---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
	title="Privacy Policy - Yet Another Software Suite"
	description="How Yet Another Software Suite handles the data collected through this site."
	url="https://yassrobotics.com/privacy"
>
	<section class="py-16 sm:py-20 px-4 sm:px-6">
		<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
			<h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold mb-4 text-ink">Privacy Policy</h1>
			<p class="font-mono text-faint text-sm mb-12">Last updated August 2026</p>

			<div class="space-y-10 text-sm sm:text-base text-dim leading-relaxed">
				<div>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-3">What we collect</h2>
					<p>
						If you message us on Discord, email us, or use the contact form, we see whatever you send us: your message, your username or email address, and anything else you choose to include. If you sign up for a newsletter or announcement list, we keep your email address for that purpose only.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-3">Links to other services</h2>
					<p>
						This site links out to GitHub, Discord, Instagram, and our Fourthwall merch store. Each of those is a separate service with its own privacy policy and its own data practices, which we don't control. Anything you do on those platforms is covered by their policies, not this one.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-3">Cookies and analytics</h2>
					<p>
						This site may use basic, privacy-respecting analytics to understand which pages get visited, so we know what to keep improving. We don't sell data, and we don't run ad-tracking scripts.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-3">Minors</h2>
					<p>
						YASS is built for FRC and FTC teams, and a lot of our users are students under 18. We don't knowingly collect more information from minors than what's described above (a Discord username, an email address for a newsletter), and we never require personal information beyond that to use any of our libraries or docs.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-3">Questions</h2>
					<p>
						If you want your information removed from anything we directly control (like a newsletter list), reach out on <a href="https://discord.gg/yass" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-yass-600 hover:underline">Discord</a> or through the <a href="/contact" class="text-yass-600 hover:underline">contact page</a> and we'll take care of it.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
